---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
import SectionHeader from "../components/SectionHeader.astro";
import SectionWork from "../components/SectionWork.astro";
import SectionServices from "../components/SectionServices.astro";
import ServiceOverlays from "../components/ServiceOverlays.astro";
import SectionContact from "../components/SectionContact.astro";
import SectionFooter from "../components/SectionFooter.astro";
---

<Base homepage>
  <SectionHeader home />
  <main id="main" tabindex="-1">
    <section class="section wrap about" aria-labelledby="about-heading">
      <header class="section-head about__head">
        <h2 class="note note--ink" id="about-heading">ABOUT</h2>
      </header>

      <div class="about__copy">
        <p>Hi, I'm Vipul, a visual designer currently based in India. First, thank you for taking time out of your day to look at my work and what I do. In this field, that means a lot to me.</p>

        <p>I've always been fascinated by how things look and the emotions they evoke. Growing up, I often had to live life vicariously through others, more as a spectator than someone who got to experience things firsthand. That made me appreciate the details of everything much more, and I think that's where my fascination with design began.</p>

        <p>I've worked across campaigns, identities, editorial design, social content and motion. I enjoy constantly moving between different kinds of projects, especially when there's room to experiment. Going forward, I'd like to work more closely with visionaries who want to make something truly different and push the boundaries of unconventional design.</p>

        <p>There's still a lot I want to learn and make. I hope you enjoy my work.</p>
      </div>
    </section>
    <SectionWork />
    <SectionServices />
    <ServiceOverlays />
    <SectionContact />
    <SectionFooter />
  </main>
</Base>
